MCD-rPPG~\cite{egorov2025mcd} is a third-party dataset that is not redistributed with this work; obtain it from its authors. Subject identifiers, the split manifest and checksums, the source code, trained checkpoints, the claim registry (\texttt{paper/claims.json}), the literature record (\texttt{paper/literature.json}), the saved window-level results and all analysis scripts are in the public repository that accompanies this paper.
